YANI: blessed magic whistle

As the game is, if you have a lot of pets and a magic whistle, every
time you go stairs up or down you have to blow the whistle a lot of
times until all pets (or at least more than one) are within the radius
to climb with you. This becomes very boring as the number of pets one
have grows.

IIRC, someone wrote a patch to fix this behaviour by increasing the
follow between levels radius. But I think I have a better idea: 
blessed magic whistles should teleport your pets right to your sides,
or at least with higher chances (based on luck, perhaps?). What do you
think?

